NOTE ON DATASET LICENSES
------------------------
This repository describes and links to third-party datasets. The data itself
is NOT covered by this license. Each dataset retains its original license,
which is reproduced and linked from its corresponding page under datasets/.

Samples committed to samples/ are only from datasets with permissive licenses
(UCI Online Retail CC BY 4.0; US Census public domain; Kaggle CC0). All other
datasets are exploration-only and must be fetched by the user — see scripts/.
